{"id":"chatcmpl-7dd8f4f5-0727-4d19-9a6a-0fa32fbfa7cd","object":"chat.completion","created":1795252093,"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","reasoning_content":"","content":"```json\n{\n  \"highlights\": \"This task succeeds by resolving a binary diagnostic choice through targeted spatial localization rather than holistic image interpretation. The key move is decomposing the answer options into their distinguishing attributes (laterality and lobe) and querying a domain expert specifically for those attributes. The pattern generalizes to any forced-choice visual or diagnostic task where options differ along a small number of identifiable dimensions.\",\n  \"patterns\": [\n    \"Decompose answer options into their distinguishing attributes (e.g., side, region, severity) and query the expert specifically for those attributes rather than asking for a full diagnosis.\",\n    \"When options are mutually exclusive along a single axis (left vs right), direct the expert query to resolve that axis explicitly to avoid ambiguity.\",\n    \"Use a domain-specific expert tool for perceptual/localization judgments, and reserve the final answer step for mapping the expert's localized finding back to the option set.\",\n    \"Ground the final answer in the expert's stated localization (side + region) and cite that reasoning as justification, rather than re-interpreting the image independently.\"\n  ],\n  \"playbooks\": {\n    \"Medical imaging multiple-choice\": \"Identify the discriminating feature between options (laterality, lobe, modality) and ask the expert to report that feature explicitly before selecting.\",\n    \"Visual forced-choice localization\": \"Convert each option into a spatial predicate (side/region) and query for the predicate that separates the candidates.\",\n    \"Expert-tool-assisted QA\": \"Route the perceptual subtask to the specialized tool, then map its structured finding onto the provided option labels.\"\n  },\n  \"checklists\": [\n    \"Confirm the expert's reported laterality and region match exactly one option before answering.\",\n    \"Verify the chosen option's distinguishing attribute (e.g., left vs right) is explicitly supported by the expert's localization statement.\"\n  ]\n}\n```"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":404,"total_tokens":783,"completion_tokens":379,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":404},"completion_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":379}}}